    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can use your Channel Divinity to consecrate the ground around you in a 30-foot radius. Each creature of your choise within range must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking radiant damage equal to your Paladin level + your Charisma modifier on a failed save, or half as much on a successful save. Additional, each friendly creature within range gains a number of temporary hit points equal to half your Paladin level + your Charisma modifier.</p>",
